  ('zcrm_5797994000003248606', 'Carbon Chicken Project', 'Carbon Chicken Project', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Richard lms', 'Manufacturer of a soil amendment and fertilizer product intended to revitalize and improve soil quality using animal refuse and biochar. The company harnesses the power of biochar and the nutrients locked in chicken litter to reduce water pollution and upcycles waste to deliver a powerful combination of benefits for the environment, enabling farmers to improve the microbial activity in their soil, minimize water runoff, and reduce the need for conventional synthetic fertilizers.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 18:50:59', '2025-09-28 11:47:35', '2025-09-28 11:47:35'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003248637', 'The SMART Tire Company', 'The SMART Tire Company', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Earl Cole', 'Developer of airless tires intended to commercialize a category of tires invented for the future of space exploration. The company''s tires offer an elastic properties, and durability, and are made from a shape memory alloy that can expand, contract, bend, or unbend and can also move heavy objects, even with deformation, enabling the terrestrial tire industry to optimize the tire technology for all major transportation uses and other commercial applications.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 18:53:57', '2025-09-28 11:44:30', '2025-09-28 11:44:30'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003248707', 'Quantum Research Sciences', 'Quantum Research Sciences', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Ethan', 'Developer of artificial Intelligence, machine learning, and quantum software intended for technology development. The company generates computing programs at the project level to deliver specific programs, enabling clients to deliver relevant tools or comprehensive applications.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-24 17:20:26', '2025-10-07 13:52:12', '2025-10-07 13:52:12'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003249118', 'Onrise', 'Onrise', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Kim Quigley', '"Onrise works with teams, clubs, leagues, players’ associations and other sports organizations to provide comprehensive, high-quality, mental health care to their athletes. Onrise’s unique approach connects athletes with the right level of care through a dedicated care team that offers athlete-specific mental health peer support, therapy and psychiatry under one roof."', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Rejected', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 15:19:51', '2026-03-16 12:21:35', '2026-03-16 12:21:35'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003249154', 'Grüns', 'Grüns', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Chad Janis', '"Transform your health by filling your nutrient gaps. Over 92% of people are deficient in the critical nutrients that Grüns covers. Carefully formulated with 60 potent ingredients to revive whole body vitality."', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Rejected', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 16:06:04', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003249189', 'Clevr Blends', 'Clevr Blends', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Hannah Mendoza', '"The first instant oat milk wellness lattes in the world. They’re just like your coffee shop favorites, but with some serious upgrades. We use functional mushrooms and adaptogenic herbs in our lattes to promote steady, long-term energy without the crash. Just add water for effortless wellness, anywhere."', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Rejected', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 16:40:06', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003249224', 'Three Wishes', 'Three Wishes', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Margaret Wishingrad', '"a high protein, low sugar, grain free breakfast cereal, that tastes like the cereals of your childhood, made with modern day clean ingredients. Three Wishes is made of chickpea, pea protein, and tapioca - a feat of food science that took 2 years of development. With 70% less sugar and as much as 8x more protein than their decadent counterparts"', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Rejected', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 17:28:51', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003250033', 'Harmoni Solutions', 'Harmoni Solutions', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Adam', 'Developer of a CNC machine monitoring and data collection system that utilizes long-range RFID technology. Harmoni''s system optimizes operations by automatically detecting nearby employees and jobs, simplifies time record entry into ERP systems, and provides a holistic view of shop capacity and performance by combining machine data with transactional data.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-18 14:25:55', '2025-09-21 08:20:47', '2025-09-21 08:20:47'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003250084', 'Mbodi AI', 'Mbodi AI', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Sebastian Peralta', 'Developer of a robotics platform designed to offer an open-source platform to facilitate robot learning. The company''s platform offers a suite of tools for data collection, training, and inference with seamless integration, hassle-free open data access, and typed explicit action spaces, enabling developers to streamline the robot learning process', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-21 07:43:07', '2025-09-29 04:05:58', '2025-09-29 04:06:38'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003250110', 'Muvr', 'Muvr', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Rico Suarez', 'Provider of an on-demand logistics service intended for same-day moving, delivery, and junk removal. The company offers real-time tracking, transparent pricing, flexible scheduling, and gig worker integration through a mobile app interface, enabling commercial clients & customers to efficiently coordinate logistics needs while providing independent workers with flexible earning opportunities and scalable service fulfillment across urban markets.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Not Interested', 'Marina Rezhda', '2025-09-21 07:47:06', '2025-10-01 11:17:13', '2025-10-01 11:17:31'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003250136', 'KMB Telematics', 'KMB Telematics', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Bryan Cattle', 'Developer of a digital radar technology designed to detect stationary and hovering drones for addressing evolving threats. The company develops imaging radar systems for autonomous machines to image moving and stationary targets in the same scene without the need for accurate position, navigation or timing (PNT) information for unprecedented vigilance and provides precise, real-time detection capabilities to counter even advanced drone tactics, enabling organizations to enhance battlefield awareness by identifying hard-to-detect aerial targets.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 07:50:45', '2025-09-21 07:50:45', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003250162', '14bis Supply Tracking', '14bis Supply Tracking', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Eleanor Mitch', 'Developer of a supply chain and logistics platform designed to improve safety and transparency in the interconnectivity of databases to track assets. The company''s platform uses blockchain and data analytics to deliver high-octane systems and provide end-to-end visibility of assets, enabling aerospace and defense organizations to improve safety and reduce costs.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 07:55:39', '2025-09-21 07:55:39', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003250188', 'General Hypersonics', 'General Hypersonics', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Mark Russell', 'Developer of a hypersonic velocity platform intended to offer global security and prosperity through enhanced velocity. The company offers hypersonic test and evaluation, drone deployment, and payload delivery in direct and indirect trajectories, through mobile, land, and sea routes, enabling clients to access affordable hypersonic systems with time-critical flight capabilities for long-range missions.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Vertical/Thesis Fit', 'Marina Rezhda', '2025-09-21 07:58:19', '2025-10-14 17:02:22', '2025-10-14 17:02:22'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003250214', 'Swift Manufacturing & Engineering', 'Swift Manufacturing & Engineering', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Charles Heidenreich', 'Operator of a contract manufacturing and engineering firm intended to deliver quality machining and assembly services. The company specializes in Computer Numerical Control (CNC) machining, low-to-mid volume production, prototyping, assembly, metal manufacturing, new product development, and industrial engineering, enabling businesses to efficiently create difficult-to-manufacture parts and improve their productivity.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 08:01:57', '2025-09-21 08:01:57', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003250240', 'Orama AI', 'Orama AI', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Kushagra Jain', 'Developer of scanner device designed to help visually impaired people learn braille code. The company''s technology transcends visible landscapes, capturing both physical and unseen environments by a smart glove that empowers individuals through real-time braille-to-speech translation, enabling users to translate braille code to speech.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 08:04:48', '2025-09-21 08:04:48', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003250266', 'Westwood Aerogel', 'Westwood Aerogel', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Daniel Farzannekou', 'Manufacturer of aerogel insulation intended for battery pack protection and thermal insulation. The company uses low-cost and scalable manufacturing processes, enabling construction and manufacturing industries to improve energy efficiency and reduce emissions.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'On Hold', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 08:08:08', '2026-02-15 19:02:25', '2026-02-15 19:02:25'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003250292', 'Adaract', 'Adaract', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Joseph Hill', 'Manufacturer of artificial muscle actuators intended to provide stronger, lighter, and smaller motion services. The company specializes in offering proprietary valve technology and customized turnkey services that can be used in bionics, robotics, aerospace, defense, and equipment, enabling industries to provide additional value through reliability improvements, compliance, and energy efficiency.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Not Interested', 'Marina Rezhda', '2025-09-21 08:14:31', '2025-10-21 10:08:30', '2025-10-21 10:08:40'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003250318', 'QuantaPanel', 'QuantaPanel', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Jay Reyher', 'Manufacturer of insulated glass systems designed to minimize substantial energy loss that occurs in existing buildings. The company''s systems serve as energy-efficient storm windows and are coated with advanced materials that limit the energy loss, enabling building owners to achieve energy savings that were previously only available through the substantially costly option of window replacement.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 08:20:31', '2025-09-21 08:20:31', NULL),
