  ('zcrm_5797994000003250542', 'Optifye.ai', 'Optifye.ai', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Vivaan Baid', 'Developr of an artificial intelligence-based optimizing platform designed to improve manufacturing efficiency. The company''s platform provides camera-based monitoring, real-time production tracking, automated reporting, cycle time analysis and bottleneck detection for assembly lines, enabling clients to measure workspace output accurately, identify inefficiencies, and optimize production processes.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 10:40:54', '2025-09-22 10:40:54', NULL),
