  ('zcrm_5797994000003250594', 'Kool Kapz', 'Kool Kapz', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Charles Christenson Jr.', 'Manufacturer of a head cooling cap intended to enhance safety during recreational and work activities outdoors. The company specializes in cooling headwear, including baseball caps and bucket hats, integrating gel packs to provide effective head relief from heat, enabling users to stay comfortable during physical outdoor activities.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 10:49:36', '2025-09-22 10:49:36', NULL),
