  ('zcrm_5797994000003251219', 'DISTINCT Technologies', 'DISTINCT Technologies', 'Edward Lundy', 'Jimmy McCloud', 'Developer of a live data intelligence platform designed to help global brands turn real-time consumer interactions into measurable growth. The company offers unified measurement, predictive insights, and personalized experiences across live engagement touchpoints, enabling enterprises to build stronger customer relationships and drive quantifiable ROI.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 18:16:19', '2025-10-22 10:10:58', '2025-10-22 10:10:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251248', 'Quorus', 'Quorus', 'Edward Lundy', 'John Hill', 'Developer of the financing platform designed to simplify the process of personalized investing. The company offers customized investment strategies and oversees day-to-day portfolio management, including tax-loss harvesting as well as tax management, enabling advisors to spend less time trading accounts and more time building their business.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 18:21:28', '2025-09-23 18:21:28', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251274', 'Covenant', 'Covenant', 'Edward Lundy', 'Jennifer Berrent', 'Operator of an AI-powered law firm intended to streamline legal workflows for private market investors. The company offers a platform built by lawyers and technologists that reduces legal fees, increases transaction speed, and provides data insights across investment processes, enabling institutional investors such as endowments, foundations, and sovereign wealth funds to manage legal work more efficiently.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 18:24:53', '2025-09-23 18:50:15', '2025-09-23 18:50:15'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251326', 'Veris.AI', 'Veris.AI', 'Edward Lundy', 'Dr. Mehdi Jamei', 'Developer of an artificial intelligence (AI)-powered synthetic data engine designed for AI agents enhancement. The company builds a simulated digital replica of enterprise work environments for AI agents to interact with and learn on the job, enabling AI developers to improve agents'' reliability and autonomy without using sensitive or proprietary information.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 18:37:59', '2025-09-23 18:37:59', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251416', 'Odynn', 'Odynn', 'Edward Lundy', 'John Garner', 'Developer of a AI-powered, fintech platform designed for comparing rewards and cash pricing for hotels and flights. The company''s platform re-imagined customer loyalty while generating significant revenues for its partners, enabling travelers to maximize their returns based on primary spending and make informed booking decisions.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 18:57:49', '2025-09-23 18:58:47', '2025-09-23 18:58:47'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251492', 'HoneyHive', 'HoneyHive', 'Edward Lundy', 'Mohak Sharma', 'Developer of an observability and evaluation platform designed for large language model applications. The company''s platform analyzes model performance, runs experiments in production, fine-tunes foundation models using proprietary data to evaluate model performance in production and makes continuous, data-driven improvements, enabling developers to continuously test, debug, monitor and improve their artificial intelligence-powered products with human feedback and objective metrics.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 19:03:09', '2025-09-23 19:03:09', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251518', 'Pace AI', 'Pace AI', 'Edward Lundy', 'Victoria Pu', 'Developer of an AI-native learning platform designed for English language learning. The company''s platform transforms content such as workforce training manuals, authentic materials like news articles, and open education resources into personalized, interactive lessons tailored to different student levels'' experiences, enabling clients to upload any content with adaptive skills-based exercises, and real-time feedback to improve learner''s English language skills in a customized and effective manner.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 19:05:38', '2025-09-23 19:05:38', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251544', 'Kyte', 'Kyte', 'Edward Lundy', 'Alice Ferrari', 'Operator of an online booking platform intended to simplify access to airline application programming interface. The company''s platform offers direct bookings, real-time results, and one integration for all ancillaries, enabling travel agencies and other travel providers to offer flights and airline ancillaries directly to their customers.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 19:12:49', '2025-09-23 19:12:49', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251570', 'Ekyam.ai', 'Ekyam.ai', 'Edward Lundy', 'Abi Sachdeva', 'Developer of an AI-based supply chain management software designed to help the retail industry to optimize communication and data flow across various platforms. The company''s software offers a wide range of features like automated data exchange, data extraction, format mapping, and integrated lookups, helping clients eliminate manual data entry and errors by automating data exchange across their entire business ecosystem.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 19:18:04', '2025-09-23 19:18:04', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251596', 'AdvanceIQ.ai', 'AdvanceIQ.ai', 'Edward Lundy', 'Tomo Matsuo', 'AdvanceIQ.ai delivers intelligent infrastructure for the SMB alternative lending ecosystem. Built for originators, syndicators, and capital partners, our platform transforms fragmented data into high-impact decisions — from deal-level underwriting to portfolio-wide strategy.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 19:22:12', '2025-09-23 19:22:12', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251622', 'Endian AI', 'Endian AI', 'Edward Lundy', 'Anand Dhandhania', 'At Endian AI, we offer a "high-touch, outcome-focused model" for software product development that combines deep customer integration with cutting-edge AI technology. Our approach goes beyond traditional consulting by embedding engineers, product managers, and technical experts within client teams to develop tailored solutions for complex, data-heavy industries.
What sets us apart is our state-of-the-art AI toolkit, which we leverage to drive tangible improvements and achieve specific business goals. Unlike standard SaaS models, we focus on long-term partnerships and measurable outcomes rather than providing off-the-shelf software functionality.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 19:26:26', '2025-09-23 19:26:26', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251648', 'Praxie', 'Praxie', 'Edward Lundy', 'Gabriel Mendoza', 'Praxie is a technology company that provides a digitization platform tailored for the manufacturing sector. Founded by Michael Lynch, the company offers a no-code solution that helps manufacturers automate processes traditionally managed with whiteboards, huddle boards, and Excel sheets. This platform unifies machine data, applications, and databases to enhance operational efficiency.
Praxie''s platform incorporates artificial intelligence, including generative AI models, to support lean manufacturing processes. Users can input data digitally, which the system analyzes and summarizes to suggest actionable improvements. This integration of AI empowers manufacturers to make informed decisions and drive continuous improvement.
The company''s services focus on process digitization and automation, AI-powered analytics, and seamless operational management. Praxie primarily targets manufacturing companies looking to modernize their process management and leverage AI technologies for better decision-making.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 19:28:58', '2025-09-23 19:28:58', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251674', 'Argus Systems', 'Argus Systems', 'Edward Lundy', 'Drew Borinstein', 'Building data and evaluation infrastructure to accelerate robotics model development.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 19:31:03', '2025-09-23 19:31:03', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251700', 'Fovus', 'Fovus', 'Edward Lundy', 'Fengbo Ren', 'Fovus is a technology company that operates an AI-powered serverless high-performance computing (HPC) platform. This platform is designed to enhance scientific discoveries and engineering breakthroughs by improving productivity and accelerating innovation while lowering costs.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 19:35:31', '2025-09-23 19:35:31', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003251731', 'SOURCIX', 'SOURCIX', 'Edward Lundy', 'Or Jacobovitz', 'SOURCIX is a technology company that specializes in AI-driven procurement solutions for custom mechanical parts. Founded in 2024 and based in the United States, SOURCIX operates a sophisticated SaaS platform and a global marketplace designed to simplify and optimize the sourcing and vendor management process.
