  ('zcrm_5797994000003254079', 'GEIOS technology', 'GEIOS Technology', 'Ty Legeyt', 'Shad Serroune', 'GEIOS Technologies develops next-generation geothermal systems designed to deliver clean, reliable, and scalable baseload energy by tapping into deep earth heat with innovative engineering. The company’s mission is to accelerate the transition to sustainable energy through advanced geothermal solutions.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ty LeGeyt', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Vertical/Thesis Fit', NULL, '2025-09-22 10:28:12', '2025-10-28 16:12:52', '2025-10-28 16:12:52'),
