  ('zcrm_5797994000003254154', 'Artveoli', 'Artveoli', 'Ty Legeyt', 'Alina Adams', 'Artveoli develops indoor air panels that use photosynthetic microalgae in biochips to convert CO₂ into oxygen, improving air quality in homes, offices, and hospitals. Their scalable systems are designed to increase wellness, productivity, and safety by bringing fresh air indoors.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ty LeGeyt', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-22 11:09:39', '2025-10-28 16:10:15', '2025-10-28 16:10:15'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254189', 'Wonderfil', 'Wonderfil', 'Ty Legeyt', 'Amelia Eichel', 'Wonderfil is creating bulk distribution systems for liquid and cream products that are as reliable and convenient as single-use plastic bottles. Their approach reduces packaging waste while offering scalable infrastructure for sustainable consumer goods.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ty LeGeyt', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-22 11:23:42', '2025-10-28 16:09:38', '2025-10-28 16:09:38'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254224', 'Wire', 'Wire', 'Ty Legeyt', 'Nick Drombosky', 'Wire (formerly Leef) is building sustainable urban mobility solutions, focusing on lightweight, efficient transportation that reduces congestion and environmental impact. The company emphasizes design and usability to make micro-mobility accessible and appealing to everyday commuters.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ty LeGeyt', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-22 11:35:38', '2025-10-28 16:09:07', '2025-10-28 16:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254272', 'Duranium', 'Duranium', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Brenden Prins-McKinney', 'Manufacturer of metal production equipment designed to increase productivity in mineral production. The company offers a novel reactor that recycles CO₂ emissions back into feedstock (CO) while generating a valuable co-product (bleaching agents), and its closed loop slashes emissions, delivering quality metal pricing without subsidies, enabling mineral companies to unlock the potential of carbochlorination in critical mineral production.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 07:28:01', '2025-09-23 07:28:01', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254335', 'Nudge', 'Nudge', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Quintin Frerichs', 'Nudge is a neurotechnology company using non-invasive, ultrasound-based stimulation and imaging to target specific areas of the brain with high precision. Their technology aims to unlock new treatments for neurological and psychiatric conditions by making brain interventions safer, more targeted, and scalable. Founded by Quintin F, Nudge is working at the intersection of neuroscience, engineering, and healthcare innovation to reshape how we approach brain health.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-24 09:03:24', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254370', 'Vonova', 'Vonova', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Wesley Jones', 'Vonova is developing a minimally invasive neurovascular system that uses the body’s venous pathways to access the brain’s surface without drilling through the skull. Their Cerebro / Cerebro Clear platform is designed for treating chronic subdural hematoma and has broader potential in neural diagnostics, neuromodulation, and brain-computer interfaces. Backed by investors like XEIA, Device of Tomorrow Capital, and SmartGate VC, Vonova is advancing toward clinical development and regulatory milestones.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-24 09:08:18', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254405', 'Cogwear', 'Cogwear', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'David Yonce', 'CogWear is developing a wearable headband that delivers clinical-grade EEG measurements outside of traditional labs to monitor brain activity with high accuracy. Their platform provides real-time insights into brain states such as alertness, fatigue, and stress through a companion app, helping users and clinicians better track cognitive health. With a new R&D and production facility in St. Paul, CogWear is scaling manufacturing and pursuing regulatory clearance to expand into both health and performance markets.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-24 09:16:07', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254478', 'Tristar AI', 'Tristar AI', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Salem Karani', 'Developer of an AI-based platform designed to monitor machine health and maintenance tasks in factories. The company''s platform provides complete visibility on maintenance, a dashboard to view alerts and add maintenance tasks, real-time performance, minimizing false alerts, and creating powerful AI models, offers on-site edge compute devices with cameras, and sends instant alerts to supervisors, managers, and operators notifying them of missed tasks, enabling clients to have continuous production with minimum interruptions.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-24 18:59:01', '2025-09-24 18:59:01', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254504', 'Flitch', 'Flitch', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Anthony Ho', 'Developer of an enterprise resource planning software designed to offer intelligent inventory control with predictive purchasing. The company''s software offers artificial intelligence-guided reorder points and buy transfer suggestions to optimize stock levels and cash flow, enabling firms to manage inventory, purchasing, and pricing across all branches in real time.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-24 19:02:05', '2025-09-24 19:02:05', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254531', 'Acumino', 'Acumino', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Patrick Jarvis', 'Developer of a robotic intelligence platform designed to enable robot makers and users to perform complex human tasks. The company''s platform trains and pre-trains robotic actions, significantly enhancing the range of tasks that can be performed and helping robots to work more effectively and safely alongside humans in various sectors, enabling businesses with complex bimanual assembly operations to build intelligent robots.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-24 19:06:56', '2025-09-24 19:06:56', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254557', 'Insane Cyber', 'Insane Cyber', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Daniel Gunter', 'Developer of a cybersecurity platform designed to help analysts and plant managers to protect critical infrastructure from complex cyber threats. The company''s platform offers data collection such as network traffic, system logs, user activity, and digital artifacts and automated analysis using advanced algorithms and machine learning techniques for incident response, recovery, and restoration processes offers managed services, enabling clients to protect operational technology environments and ensuring the security of critical infrastructures.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-24 19:09:35', '2025-09-24 19:09:35', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254584', 'InOrbit', 'InOrbit', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Julian Cerruti', 'Developer of a cloud-based robotics management platform designed to support efficient robotic operations. The company''s platform permits remote data collection, monitoring, and control without the need for a virtual private network using industry-standard Internet of Things protocols to handle spotty connections and provides source code access for inspection of any robot-side code and its technology includes adaptive diagnostics and predictive analytics, enabling robotics companies and operators to develop, deploy and operate smart robots at a global scale.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-24 19:12:37', '2025-09-24 19:12:37', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254610', 'Detect Auto', 'Detect Auto', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Nate Oelke', 'Developer of an AI-driven analytics platform designed for auto repair shops and dealerships. The company''s platform offers auto-generated reports, customer analysis, repair analytics, and continuous improvement and also aims to revolutionize repair processes, making them efficient, accurate and user-friendly, enabling shops and dealerships to get full access to their repair software.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-24 19:14:57', '2025-09-24 19:14:57', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254641', 'Lumetec', 'Emancro', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Frederik Ebert', 'Developer of general-purpose robots designed to improve people''s lives. The company''s robots can pick and handle any type of item, visually identify and correct misplaced items, pull bins from shelves, count items, and open drawers, enabling pharmacy staff to automate repetitive and time-consuming tasks.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-24 19:19:23', '2025-09-24 19:19:23', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254695', 'Aerovy', 'Aerovy', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Nick Gunady', 'Developer of a cloud-based software designed to offer support to electric aircraft. The company''s software connects to every device that generates or distributes power across business sites by using foundational AI-driven algorithms, enabling clients to take steps towards sustainable aviation.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-26 19:20:44', '2025-09-26 19:20:44', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003254721', 'CloudForge', 'CloudForge', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Benjamin Marans', 'Developer of an AI-based software designed for workflow automation and data insights in inventory management processes. The company''s software streamlines inventory control with smart search capabilities, on-time updates, automated reordering and demand forecasting, optimizing stock levels, enabling businesses to inventory track and reduce inventory costs.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-26 19:23:11', '2025-09-26 19:23:11', NULL),
