  ('zcrm_5797994000003256983', 'Areii', 'Areii', 'Jacob Dooley', 'Chris Marshall', 'Areii is the smartest way to invest in real estate. Areii is an AI powered assistant and platform to help real estate investors secure funding, find and mange contractors, analyze deals and so much more.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Jacob Dooley', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-29 08:31:11', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003257072', 'iPill', 'iPill', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'John Hsu', 'Developer of a secure medication dispenser intended to help remove barriers to Suboxone Opioid Use Disorder (OUD) therapy by offering safe, effective, at-home treatment. The company''s device addresses the opioid crisis that predominantly impacts low-income communities by destroying unused medication, controlled dispensing, and medication adherence tracking by creating a tamper-proof home dispenser for opioids, enabling healthcare systems to take steps towards addressing unequal prescribing practices and standardizing care.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PB', 'Have not Reached out', 'MF', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 14:59:45', '2026-01-27 14:37:11', '2026-01-27 14:37:11'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003257098', 'Onto Health', 'Onto Health', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Traci Keen', 'Provider of a healthcare innovation platform designed to expand access to specialty care through a hybrid model combining digital tools, AI-driven workflows, and decentralized clinics. The company offers advanced family-building services, including IVF, IUI, and egg freezing, alongside proprietary provider training and patient education, enabling generalist providers and fertility practices to offer cost-effective, scalable care to patients nationwide.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PB', 'Have not Reached out', 'MF', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 15:03:07', '2026-01-27 16:29:22', '2026-01-27 16:29:22'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003257124', 'CARI Health', 'CARI Health', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Patrik Schmidle', 'Operator of a sensor-enabled digital health company intended to develop remote medication monitoring solutions to inform personalized dosing. The company offers a wearable remote medication monitor that consists of wireless sensors that are worn on the patient''s skin and send data about real-time medication levels to the cloud, enabling clinicians to safely dose and titrate life-saving medications with a narrow therapeutic window.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'MF', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 15:04:41', '2026-01-27 16:31:43', '2026-01-27 16:31:43'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003257155', 'Galacxia', 'Galacxia', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Sandy Eulitt', 'Developer of a mobile safety and care platform designed to enhance well-being, reduce healthcare costs, and protect lives through proactive, passive emergency response and digital health tools. The company offers passive check-ins, AI-driven health risk analysis, escalation protocols, and integrated care support, enabling elderly individuals, discharged patients, employees, and underserved populations to live independently, avoid preventable harm, and access timely care.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'MF', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 15:58:29', '2026-01-27 14:38:20', '2026-01-27 14:38:20'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003257181', 'Nicolette', 'Nicolette', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Phil Martie', 'Developer of a patient empowerment platform designed to visualize complex medical data. The company''s platform translates critical health data and offers visual, audio, and display of medical data and research that empowers patients and their families to be competent members of their own care team on day one, enabling parents to understand premature babies'' plans of care and track their progress.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Muhammad Faisal', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 16:06:36', '2026-01-27 16:29:29', '2026-01-27 16:29:29'),
