  ('zcrm_5797994000003268328', 'Radiolife', 'Radiolife', 'Brandon McClean', 'Sergio Schirmer', 'Developer of a cutting-edge biotechnology company intended to revolutionize diagnostics through advanced artificial intelligence-powered radio-frequency biosensing technology. The company''s proprietary platform enables reagent-less, accurate, and fast (under 20 seconds) pathogen detection, unlocking new possibilities for early disease detection, personalized medicine, and remote patient monitoring, enabling patients to improve longevity by cost-effectively improving their quality of life.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Brandon McClean', 'On Hold', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-01 08:11:33', '2026-02-15 18:55:28', '2026-02-15 18:55:28'),
