  ('zcrm_5797994000003273249', 'Podonos', 'Podonos', 'Priyanshi Sitlani', 'Soohyun Bae', 'Developer of an artificial intelligence-based AI model analysis platform designed to shorten the analysis and data collection tasks. The company''s platform is capable of evaluating in multiple languages to verify performance in more sophisticated and diverse environments, enabling developers to save time and cost while improving model quality.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Priyanshi Sitlani', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-01 06:46:11', '2026-01-28 07:18:13', '2026-01-28 07:18:13'),
