  ('zcrm_5797994000003273489', 'Arcuro Medical', 'Arcuro Medical', 'Aaditya Jain', 'Lee Ranon', 'Developer of an all-suture meniscus repair system designed for the anatomic repair of the meniscus. The company''s system consists of a knotless, all-suture implant and innovative delivery system for a meniscus repair which is performed inside the joint space using suture material, enabling medical practitioners to perform treatment with safe, reliable, and effective meniscus repairs.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Aaditya Jain', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-02 15:12:11', '2026-01-08 08:37:11', '2026-01-08 08:37:11'),
