  ('zcrm_5797994000003274130', 'Digit', 'Digit', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Daniel', 'Developer of a cloud inventory and manufacturing software designed for enterprises. The company''s software automates tasks such as data entry, reporting, and analysis assisting companies to focus more on strategic activities and improve their bottom line, enabling businesses to plan, procure, store, produce, sell, and ship, all through a single platform.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shakshi Patel', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-30 14:07:37', '2025-09-30 14:07:37', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003275018', 'Theta Software', 'Theta Software', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Rayan Garg', 'Developer of an AI-based self-learning platform designed to build the infrastructure for agents to learn and adapt in real-time. The company''s AI software has a benchmark for computer and browser use agents managing end-to-end workflows across consumer, construction, finance, healthcare, marketing, sales, and supply chain which is used in real-world workflows and software tools across these industries, with synthetic versions of enterprise platforms such as SAP and CapIQ and also providing computer environment infrastructure for effective evaluation and post-training at scale, enabling businesses to reduce their automation errors and increase efficiency.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-30 07:25:04', '2025-09-30 07:25:04', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003275044', 'Pivot Robots', 'Pivot Robots', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Siddharth Girdhar', 'Developer of an AI vision control software designed to speed up robotic integrations in the manufacturing sector. The company makes artificial intelligence software for robotic arms with the dangerous task of metal grinding, enabling manufacturers to automate some of their most labor-intensive tasks.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-30 07:27:06', '2025-09-30 07:27:06', NULL),
