  ('zcrm_5797994000003275096', 'Agape-1', 'Agape-1', 'Marina Rezhda', 'David Fong', 'Developer of artificial intelligence-based mobile security robots designed to deter crime and protect citizens. The company offers security robots made with the help of advanced technologies having a spectrum of capabilities, from self-navigation to intimidation interactively through three-color flashing lights, loudspeakers, and voice commands to suspicious person, enabling businesses and residential communities to safeguard their security.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-30 07:32:39', '2025-09-30 07:32:39', NULL),
