  ('zcrm_5797994000003276096', 'Beagle Learning', 'Beagle Learning', 'Edward Lundy', 'Carolyn Bickers', 'Beagle Learning helps teams learn faster while doing their best work by providing a simple, systematized process to gather input from the team and select the most important questions to focus on. Our AI system measures the quality of the questions teams choose, and automatically records the logic behind decisions made to avoid repeated work and bring new teams up to speed faster. Supported by NSF, Techstars, and LearnLaunch, Beagle Learning is now partnering with ASU to launch the Technological Leadership Major to deliver our 21st-century skills training efficiently and effectively online.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-01 05:13:05', '2025-10-01 05:13:05', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003276136', 'TeamBuilder', 'TeamBuilder', 'Edward Lundy', 'David Howard', 'TeamBuilder, LLC is a technology company focused on predictive staff scheduling solutions for ambulatory care settings. It addresses the challenges of staffing in healthcare environments with fluctuating patient demand and diverse specialties. The company’s platform utilizes predictive technology and advanced data science to create optimized staff schedules that align with patient needs and staff availability.
The core offering is a fully configurable digital scheduling platform that uses actual provider volume data to tailor schedules for each client. This approach helps healthcare organizations reduce staffing costs, improve patient access, and eliminate administrative inefficiencies. TeamBuilder’s platform allows for real-time schedule adjustments and provides operational analytics to support strategic decision-making. The company primarily serves ambulatory healthcare organizations, enhancing their operational efficiency and quality of patient care. TeamBuilder is headquartered in Waitsfield, Vermont', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-01 05:20:09', '2025-10-01 05:20:09', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003276167', 'Move the Chain', 'Move the Chain', 'Edward Lundy', 'Mylene Pedone', 'Move the Chain is a corporate social responsibility (CSR) as a service platform based in Stamford, Connecticut. Founded in 2021, the company has fewer than 25 employees and generates annual revenue under $5 million. It offers an all-in-one employee engagement platform designed to enhance connections and social impact within organizations through gamified teamwork.
The platform enables corporations to connect with nonprofits and engage employees in philanthropic activities. It facilitates charitable challenges, donations, fundraisers, and volunteering events, allowing employees to participate in company-sponsored social impact programs easily. Move the Chain also provides intuitive reporting and analytics, a comprehensive company calendar, and secure solutions to support employee engagement in CSR initiatives, particularly in remote and hybrid work environments.
The company serves corporations looking to boost employee engagement and nonprofits seeking partnerships for philanthropic efforts. Its platform is tailored to meet the evolving needs of corporate philanthropy and enhance community engagement across various work settings.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-01 05:26:18', '2025-10-01 05:26:18', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003276203', 'Constituo', 'Constituo Software', 'Edward Lundy', 'John Dording', 'Constituo provides integration products and solutions for the most commonly used systems in higher education, as well as some of the more esoteric and even homegrown systems. Constituo''s iPaaS enables our customers to rapidly build and support cost-effective, integration solutions across the enterprise. Constituo Software was founded by an experienced team that has been providing integration-related products and services to education institutions for nearly two decades. Constituo''s products and solutions are cloud-based and designed for the education customer including everything from process to pricing.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-01 05:36:40', '2025-10-01 05:36:40', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003276234', 'Brahmin Solutions', 'Brahmin Solutions', 'Edward Lundy', 'Brahm Meka', 'Cloud Inventory and MRP software for businesses.
Manage All Business Operations
ERP software shouldn''t take months to implement. Grow, manage, analyze, and automate every phase of your business with a centralized online platform and enterprise-grade tools. Get 24/7 support from inventory experts.
