  ('zcrm_5797994000003276260', 'Cherrypicker', 'Cherrypicker', 'Edward Lundy', 'CJ Tufano', 'Cherrypicker | The Future of Hiring, Redefined
Cherrypicker is a next-generation hiring platform designed to connect companies with top-tier, gainfully employed talent that isn''t actively browsing job boards. We eliminate the inefficiencies of traditional hiring by combining advanced recruiting technology with a human-first approach—streamlining the entire process without costly placement fees.
Hiring managers and talent acquisition teams rely on Cherrypicker to proactively engage high-performing candidates, maximizing hiring budgets while reducing time-to-hire. Whether you''re looking to fill a key leadership role or scale your team efficiently, Cherrypicker provides a done-with-you recruiting experience that delivers top talent directly to you.
? What We Do:
