✔️ Help businesses maximize hiring budgets with zero placement fees', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-01 05:51:36', '2025-10-01 05:51:36', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003276296', 'FinQore', 'Finqore', 'Edward Lundy', 'Vipul Shah', 'FinQore is a technology company focused on enhancing the capabilities of finance teams in complex and fast-growing businesses. The company provides a platform that consolidates financial data from various sources into a single, real-time source of truth. This platform automates data ingestion, transformation, and segmentation, allowing finance teams to access clean and AI-ready data sets for accurate financial reporting and analysis.
Key features of FinQore’s platform include the Revenue Bridge, which ensures data accuracy and automates cohort tagging, as well as advanced segmentation and automated workflows that streamline financial data processes. The platform also offers AI-powered analytics to deliver actionable insights, helping finance teams identify key business drivers and trends. FinQore’s solutions are designed for CFOs and finance teams, enabling them to improve financial visibility and operational efficiency while focusing on strategic decision-making', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-01 06:01:47', '2025-10-01 06:01:47', NULL),
