  ('zcrm_5797994000003282445', 'Better Booch', 'Better Booch', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Ashleigh Lockerbie', '"Better Booch is a premium single batch kombucha that is brewed, bottled, and canned in downtown Los Angeles. Founded by touring musicians Trey and Ashleigh Lockerbie who were struck by the lack of healthy options available on the road. The Better Booch mission is to promote and support natural remedies through a brew that is labeled accurately and meticulously tested for quality."', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Fall 2025', 'Wellness Growth Ventures', 'Reached Out', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Rejected', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-07 18:41:45', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003282480', 'BelliWelli', 'BelliWelli', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Nicholas Wilson', '"Delicious powders and snacks that deliver clinically proven benefits - meeting and exceeding your health goals has never been easier! BelliWelli Inner and Outer Beauty nutrient blends, formulated in partnership with top GI doctors to ensure ingredient efficacy and purity"', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Fall 2025', 'Wellness Growth Ventures', 'Reached Out', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Rejected', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-07 18:55:10', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003282515', 'Flaus', 'Flaus', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Samantha Coxe', '"Flaus is a DTC oral beauty brand with a patent-pending electric flosser that uses sonic vibrations and real dental floss to make flossing as quick, easy and comfortable as brushing your teeth. 
We help people keep their teeth for life by transforming daily routines into delightful rituals. We’re here to create an oral beauty platform that inspires self-acceptance and empowers self-expression for real people, real teeth and real smiles. Flaus is a Public Benefit Corporation."', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ethan Dugdale', 'Rejected', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-07 19:09:24', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003282613', 'MatterWave', 'MatterWave', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Alex Tilita Ph.D', 'Developer of ultrasonic modules designed to enhance metal additive manufacturing processes through real-time microstructure control. The company offers retrofittable technology that improves component durability, eliminates post-processing heat treatments, and enables the efficient production of high-performance, defect-free parts, empowering manufacturers in aerospace, defense, energy, and medical industries to achieve faster qualification and lower production costs.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitória Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-09 05:49:50', '2025-10-10 06:56:08', '2025-10-10 06:56:08'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003282640', 'Visionify', 'Visionify', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Priyesh Priyesh Sanghvi', 'Developer of AI-powered safety detection software designed for monitoring workplace environments through existing camera infrastructure. The company''s platform integrates with CCTV networks and processes data via on-site edge servers, delivering real-time hazard detection, PPE compliance checks, zone monitoring, forklift operation analysis, and safety event alerts, enabling manufacturing, warehousing, and logistics to strengthen compliance, reduce accidents, improve productivity, safeguard workers, and maintain operational continuity while ensuring privacy, security, and scalability in deployment.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitória Lunardi de Castro', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-10-09 05:52:57', '2026-02-11 14:42:16', '2026-02-11 14:42:16'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003282666', 'VOTIX', 'VOTIX', 'Vitoria Lunardi De Castro', 'Eduardo Bouças', 'Developer of a robotics software platform intended to support all drone manufacturers in automating drone-based workflows. The company''s software platform orchestrates, operates, and automates drones and robots, enabling users to perform missions in less time, optimizing their drone investment.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vitoria Lunardi de Castro', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-09 05:55:51', '2025-10-10 06:56:08', '2025-10-10 06:56:08'),
