  ('zcrm_5797994000003284217', 'Tilt', 'Tilt', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Joshua Holtom', 'Developer of an AI-powered transportation management platform intended to help logistics companies make informed decisions. The company''s platform offers automated load matching and bidding, real-time freight visibility and tracking with predictive insights, and automated administrative tasks such as payroll calculation and compliance checks, enabling businesses in the logistics sector to improve operational productivity, reduce manual workload, and increase cost efficiency.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Marina Rezhda', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-05 12:36:32', '2025-10-05 12:36:32', NULL),
