  ('zcrm_5797994000003288243', 'Marvix AI', 'Marvix AI', 'Edward Lundy', 'Rashie Jain', 'Developer of generative AI applications designed to automate administrative workflows in clinical environments. The company offers an AI-powered suite including ambient scribing for clinical notes, automated medical coding with ICD-10-CM and E/M modifiers, and additional productivity tools, enabling hospitals and healthcare practices to reduce clinician burnout, streamline documentation, and improve operational efficiency while allowing medical professionals to focus more on patient care.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 08:11:49', '2025-10-15 08:14:42', '2025-10-15 08:14:42'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003288269', 'WealthFeed', 'WealthFeed', 'Edward Lundy', 'Samuel Kendree', 'Developer of an AI-powered client retention platform designed to increase client retention. The company''s platform leverages advanced AI and data analytics to identify and connect with high-quality prospects and offers a suite of features that includes a robust discovery data feed, person enrichment feature, and client monitoring, enabling financial advisors and insurance agents to streamline and effectively serve clients.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 08:14:09', '2025-10-15 08:14:09', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003288301', 'Earthmover', 'Earthmover', 'Edward Lundy', 'Joseph Hamman Ph.D', 'Operator of a cloud data stack for science intended to empower customers to use scientific data to address the planet''s urgent challenges. The company offers scientific data analytics that makes it easy to store, organize, analyze, and share large datasets, enabling customers to accelerate their scientific research and make informed decisions about how to address climate change and other global challenges.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 08:17:12', '2025-10-15 08:17:12', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003288327', 'Ubicept', 'Ubicept', 'Edward Lundy', 'Sebastian Bauer Ph.D', 'Developer of image sensors designed for advanced computer vision algorithms to capture motion. The company offers advanced photon-level processing algorithms, sensor-agnostic integration, and a development kit with cameras to capture clear images in extreme lighting, high-motion, and around-corner scenarios, enabling industries like automotive and robotics to achieve reliable perception in challenging environments.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 08:19:19', '2025-10-15 08:19:19', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003288353', 'Meela AI', 'Meela AI', 'Edward Lundy', 'Josh Sach', 'Developer of an AI companion platform designed to support senior well-being and social engagement. The company''s platform facilitates personalized interactions through scheduled phone calls, offering features such as companionship-focused conversations, reminders for social connections, health signal monitoring, privacy-sensitive caretaker dashboards, and more, enabling elderly individuals and assisted living facilities to combat loneliness, foster meaningful connections, and enhance overall quality of life.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 08:21:04', '2025-10-15 08:21:04', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003288379', 'Tomorrow.io', 'Tomorrow.io', 'Edward Lundy', 'Shimon Elkabetz', 'Developer of a local weather forecasting platform designed to improve weather forecasting with new micro weather information. The company''s platform utilizes wireless signals, connected vehicles, satellite-to-ground microwave signals, street cameras, and other technologies along with traditional meteorological data sources to provide accurate, real-time, location-specific, and on-demand weather forecasts, enabling countries, businesses, and individuals to manage their weather-related challenges to improve decision-making processes in various sectors.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 08:23:12', '2025-10-15 08:23:12', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003288406', 'Impala (NY)', 'Impala (NY)', 'Edward Lundy', 'Tom Huberman', 'Developer of data analytics software designed for nonprofit organizations and philanthropic institutions. The company''s platform offers access to nonprofit and funder profiles, relationship mapping, email outreach tools, portfolio monitoring, prospect matching, ask amount suggestions, and sector benchmarking, enabling businesses to identify opportunities, connect strategically, and make informed decisions to improve fundraising, grantmaking, and network collaboration.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 08:25:03', '2025-10-15 08:25:03', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003288432', 'ShelfCycle', 'ShelfCycle', 'Edward Lundy', 'Michael Harrison', 'Developer of an AI-powered business software intended to automate daily operations with inventory, accounting and relationships in one platform. The company''s platform offers ERP and CRM in a single system that is tailored to the challenges of distributing chemical products to align with the team, enabling users to automate communication internally and externally.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Edward Lundy', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 08:27:27', '2025-10-15 08:27:27', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003289022', 'Taro', 'Taro - Software Engineer Growth', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Alex Chiou', 'Taro gives ambitious software engineers the tools to advance their career, with faster promotion, quicker onboarding, and higher compensation. Curated masterclasses, credible Q&A discussion, and expert-led live events.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-05 11:32:31', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003289127', 'Beam Child Development', 'Beam Child Development', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Mark Munro', 'Provider of pediatric therapy intended to keep educators, attract families, support every child and serve preschool. The company provides a wide range of services like speech, occupational, and physical therapy, personalized care on-site, support for teachers, developmental screenings, and parent communication, enabling teachers to manage challenging behaviors with ease.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Eyiram', 'Too Early', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-05 12:13:47', '2025-10-16 08:25:41', '2025-10-16 08:25:41'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003289162', 'Aibary', 'Aibary', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Jundong Wu', 'Developer of an audio-based learning application designed for fast, personalized knowledge consumption. The company''s platform delivers 10-minute podcast-style summaries of top nonfiction books in a swipeable, social-media-like feed, featuring AI-powered content recommendations, a vast free library, and interactive AI avatars, enabling professionals to learn digitally across diverse topics on the go', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-05 12:39:18', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003289197', 'Career Highways', 'Career Highways', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Elizabeth Eversoll', 'Career Highways provides tools to help individuals explore career paths, assess skills, and set goals. It supports students and professionals with planning resources and guidance.
Operator of a career pathing and workforce development platform intended to work together with common goals and framework. The company specializes in career mapping, personalized upskilling, employer pathway automation, and workforce engagement tools, enabling organizations to generate career awareness and enthusiasm with early access to career exploration and opportunities.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Eyiram', 'Too Early', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-05 12:54:23', '2025-10-12 09:33:40', '2025-10-12 09:33:40'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003289532', 'OPTT Health', 'OPTT Health', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Mohsen Omrani', 'OPTT offers evidence-based AI-powered digital mental health tools that augment mental health teams'' care quality and capacity. OPTT''s AI toolbox includes conversation-based triage and care path suggestions, care team assistance for the digital delivery of evidence-based psychotherapy, and progress and remote monitoring of mental healthpatients.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 07:03:52', '2026-01-28 11:47:34', '2026-01-28 11:47:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003289558', 'BetterAge', 'BetterAge', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Diana Yin', 'BetterAge provides a personalized, web-based program to help individuals improve health and well-being. It offers a three-stage structure, Awareness, Action, and Achievement, that guides users through an assessment, tailored recommendations, and tracking of person-defined goals. BetterAge creates a customized wellbeing report and gives actionablesuggestions that users can follow at their own pace. The service is offered free of charge and aims to support choices around living well and aging well, not only focused on physical health but also on life satisfaction. BetterAge also partners with other organizations and has received a grant from the National Institute on Aging to support its platform’s mission.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 07:07:43', '2026-01-28 11:47:22', '2026-01-28 11:47:22'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003289584', 'Rapid Nexus', 'Rapid Nexus', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Christine Pasciak', 'Rapid Nexus offers photonics technology and telemedicine wound healing systems, enabling users to rapidly heal wounds and be able to close open diabetic wounds. Their products include hema styl rx, gen-ray, tissue massager, derma firm air-flo, derma air-flo, and derma light tape . nanotechnology wound gel dressing formulation that has been shown tobe effective in chronic wound healing.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 07:11:45', '2026-01-28 11:47:10', '2026-01-28 11:47:10'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003289610', 'MEND', 'MEND', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Eziah Syed', 'MEND is a life sciences company with a mission to help people heal and live their healthiest lives. The company is researching and developing targeted clinical nutrition and medical food interventions to enhance patient outcomes, from injury and surgery to aging and physical performance. MEND has been adopted by numerous hospitals, health systems, professional sports teams across all major leagues, and the elite forces of the US Military.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 07:16:34', '2026-01-28 11:46:58', '2026-01-28 11:46:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003289636', 'RazorMetrics', 'RazorMetrics', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Akshay Bhandari', 'RazorMetrics creates cutting-edge pharmacy cost containment solutions to quickly and easily reduce drug costs. Its proprietary technology automatically initiates cost-saving opportunities through medication switching, deprescription, deduplication, and more–all while adapting to fit client’s plan, preferences, and formulary. RazorMetricsconveniently plugs into prescriber’s existing workflow, improving healthcare decisions while seamlessly reducing medication costs for members and plan sponsors. Based in Austin, TX, RazorMetrics supports self-funded employers, health plans, PBMs, and organizations to bring clarity, efficiency, and more value to their pharmacy benefits.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-15 07:22:15', '2026-01-28 11:46:45', '2026-01-28 11:46:45'),
