  ('zcrm_5797994000003291850', 'qubitsolve', 'qubitsolve', 'Dhruv Nimmagadda', 'Madhav Syamlal', 'QubitSolve Inc. is developing software that leverages quantum computing to enhance computational fluid dynamics (CFD) simulations, targeting the Aerospace & Defense and Automotive industries. The software employs quantum algorithms to solve partial differential equations, including the Navier-Stokes equations, aiming to achieve faster and more accurate simulations compared to traditional methods.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Dhruv Nimmagadda', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Not Interested', NULL, '2025-10-13 05:18:47', '2025-10-28 18:41:56', '2025-10-28 18:41:56'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003291876', 'peridio', 'peridio', 'Dhruv Nimmagadda', 'Bill Brock', 'Peridio provides a device management platform for connected devices, facilitating efficient release orchestration, over-the-air updates, and real-time monitoring in AIoT environments. The platform is built on a Yocto-based embedded Linux distribution, which enhances the speed of firmware and software updates while minimizing development cycles and maintenance needs.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Dhruv Nimmagadda', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-13 05:20:58', '2026-01-22 08:35:35', '2026-01-22 08:35:35'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003291907', 'aquaai corp', 'aquaai corp', 'Dhruv Nimmagadda', 'Simeon Pieterkowsky', 'Aquaai Corporation offers a fishlike data platform designed for subsurface monitoring of aquatic ecosystems, utilizing cameras and plug-n-play sensors to enhance data collection while minimizing energy use and habitat disruption. This technology is applicable in areas such as underwater farming and the management of marine protected regions.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Dhruv Nimmagadda', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-13 05:24:26', '2026-01-22 08:35:31', '2026-01-22 08:35:31'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003291934', 'cadynce', 'cadynce', 'Dhruv Nimmagadda', 'david doze', 'Cadynce offers a no-code workflow automation platform that enables users to streamline operational processes by creating applications, managing documents, and integrating data through cloud and AI technologies. The platform features a drag-and-drop interface for workflow design and advanced APIs for system connectivity.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Dhruv Nimmagadda', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-13 05:43:58', '2026-01-22 08:35:26', '2026-01-22 08:35:26'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003291960', 'terbine', 'terbine', 'Dhruv Nimmagadda', 'David Knight', 'The main product is a platform that enhances the management of electric vehicle charging networks by integrating various vendor systems to improve operational efficiency. It utilizes technologies such as artificial intelligence, machine learning, Internet of Things, and cloud computing for real-time monitoring and synchronization of vehicles, charging units, and payment systems.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Fall 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Dhruv Nimmagadda', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-10-13 05:55:28', '2026-01-22 08:35:22', '2026-01-22 08:35:22'),
