  ('zcrm_5797994000003292135', 'LingoKids', 'Lingokids', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Cristobal Viedma', 'Developer of a language learning platform designed to break down language barriers and provide equal opportunities for all kids. The company''s platform provides a learning tool that offers educational games for children to learn vocabulary and new languages, and also helps parents monitor their child''s development with progress reports, enabling kids to learn English through a game-based interactive tool.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-10-12 09:23:11', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
